# Core
**/node_modules
**/.next
# Host outputs ignored (Multi-stage build handles this)
**/out
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# IDE & System
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.git
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Data & DBs (Aggressive recursive exclusion)
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.corrupt
**/data
**/backups
**/temp_ext
**/tmp
**/test-results

# Archives
**/*.rar
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.iso

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Env
**/.env*
